---
Show the account, server and kind of login of the current profile.

Usage: hn whoami [OPTIONS]

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

Global options:
  -p, --profile <NAME>  Profile to use (server and login), see 'hn profile list'
      --json            Print JSON instead of tables (stable shape, for scripts)

Examples:
  hn whoami
  hn whoami --json
